config MT7663
	tristate "MediaTek MT7663 SDIO WiFi support (proprietary fullmac)"
	depends on CFG80211
	depends on MMC
	select WIRELESS_EXT
	select WEXT_PRIV
	help
	  This option enables support for the MediaTek MT7663 / MT7661 802.11ac
	  WiFi combo chip connected via SDIO, using the
	  MediaTek proprietary fullmac driver stack.

	  The WiFi firmware files (WIFI_RAM_CODE_MT7663.bin etc.) must be
	  present in /lib/firmware or /lib/firmware/mediatek on the target system.
	  The calibrated EEPROM file (EEPROM_MT7663.bin, 1024 bytes) and config file
	  (wifi_mt7661.cfg) must be present in /lib/firmware.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called wlan_mt7663_sdio.